      "transcriber_notes": [
        "Continuation of the fleet list begun on p0299-p0300 (pp. 260-261, 'THE CHINESE NAVY'), which is outside this batch; that part belongs in the p0299 file.",
        "Two-page spread: pp. 262 (Type ... Date of Launch) and 263 (Protection ... Boilers) are one table; rows matched in printed order (16 rows each side incl. the 'SHIPS BUILDING.' heading, which appears only on p. 262).",
        "Ditto marks printed as ',,' are kept as ',,'. Multi-line bracketed cells joined with spaces; line-break hyphens (Par-sons, Kawa-saki, cylin-drical, mul-titubular) closed up.",
        "Row 'Cruiser', Complement: printed '.230' with a stray dot before the figure; transcribed '230'.",
        "Row 'Training Cruiser ,, ,,' Draught: printed '14.9' with a full stop rather than the raised decimal point used elsewhere."
